    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Heather View — where exceptional homes meet an enviable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in Snugborough, Castlebar, Heather View offers the perfect balance of modern living, everyday convenience and the natural beauty of County Mayo. With a fantastic choice of schools, cafés, leisure facilities and retail amenities close by, everything you need is within easy reach, while the town’s excellent connectivity makes getting around simple and convenient.\r\n\r\nBeyond your doorstep, Mayo’s spectacular landscape awaits. From scenic lakes and tranquil woodland walks to mountain trails and breathtaking countryside, there are endless opportunities to get outdoors, explore and enjoy everything this beautiful part of the country has to offer.\r\n\r\nWith a superb selection of 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes, Heather View has something to suit a variety of lifestyles and stages of life. Whether you’re taking your first step onto the property ladder, looking for more space for a growing family or searching for a home where you can enjoy life to the fullest, Heather View offers an exciting opportunity to make your home in Castlebar."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Super selection of 2, 3, 4 bedroom A rated homes\r\n-Finished to a high standard throughout, with stylish, quality-fitted kitchens and contemporary tiling\r\n-Ideally positioned within walking distance of a superb range of local amenities, including the local school, shops and everyday conveniences\r\n-Incorporating the latest energy-efficient technology, the homes are designed to provide exceptional comfort, efficiency and modern-day living\r\n-Qualifying homes are eligible for the Government’s Help to Buy Scheme"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      }
